This Site
---------
This is a Nunjucks and Fastify site built to work on any screen from
almost anywhere: a modern browser, an old one, the terminal, an AI agent.

On a modern browser it is a multiplayer toroidal canvas, and a PWA.
Anyone with it open sees everyone else's cursor. From an old browser it
is a simple site, and from curl it is plain text.

